# FILE ORGANIZATION

Place new files as follows (paths relative to project root):

| Kind | Path |
|---|---|
| Subagent specs | `.cursor/agents/` |
| Config / scripts | `config/` |
| Documentation | `docs/` |
| Reports | `reports/Chat reports/` or `reports/Feedback/` + date layout |
| Test cases | `test_cases/Backend/` and optionally `test_cases/Frontend/` |
| Application repos | `<codeRoot>/` from `.cursor/project-config.json` |

Reports layout: `config/templates/reports/README.md` and Rule 0.6.
